      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It may not provide too much of a performance improvement for some systems, and for other's it will make a massive difference. It will definitely improve the overall stability of the game's framerate delivery. There are 3rd party applications that allow you adjust CPU affinity for certain processes; but having a nice convenient way to do this in game is a step in the right direction. Especially for those of us who like squeezing every drop of performance form their hardware (Me included).",
